{"question": "Find dy/dx when y = (2x + 1)^5", "groups": [{"id": "line1", "say": "We're given y equals two x plus one, all to the power five."}, {"id": "line2", "say": "Bracket to a power? Let u be the inside. So y is just u to the five."}, {"id": "line3", "say": "Differentiate each part. dy by du is five u to the power four. du by dx is two."}, {"id": "line4", "say": "Chain rule: multiply them. Then put the inside back."}, {"id": "answer", "say": "So dy by dx is ten, times two x plus one, to the power four."}, {"id": "annot", "say": "That multiply step is the chain rule. Every time."}], "strokes": [{"group": "line1", "d": "M 80 110 Q 83 125 91 139"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 102 110 L 91 140 Q 87 150 82 154"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 116 120 L 138 121"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 116 129 L 138 130"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 162 92 Q 152 120 162 148"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 169 100 Q 177 89 186 97 Q 190 107 169 140 L 190 139"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 196 110 Q 206 124 216 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 217 111 Q 207 125 196 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 236 108 L 236 132"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 225 120 L 247 120"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 258 98 Q 263 95 266 90 L 267 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 260 140 L 274 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 280 92 Q 290 120 280 148"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 307 86 L 298 85 L 297 100 Q 304 97 308 104 Q 308 114 297 113"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 82 200 Q 84 230 83 250 Q 85 252 88 246"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 96 234 L 114 234 Q 116 218 104 220 Q 94 222 94 235 Q 94 250 106 250 Q 113 250 115 244"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 132 205 L 132 245 Q 133 250 140 247"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 124 220 L 140 220"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 159 220 L 158 242 Q 159 250 167 250 Q 177 250 178 238 L 179 220 Q 179 240 182 250"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 192 230 L 214 231"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 192 239 L 214 240"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 225 210 Q 233 199 242 207 Q 246 217 225 250 L